    Module: Policy Detail Screen -> OVD (My Policies - Policy Details Screen, Mobile)

    Each test needs policies.mobileNumber + policies.otp (a customer with an active motor policy and a fixed UAT OTP)
    in src/test/resources/config.properties, or policyDetails.startUrl; without them the tests are SKIPPED.

    Eclipse: right-click this file > Run As > TestNG Suite (needs the TestNG plugin)
    Maven:   mvn test "-Dsuite=testng-sprint3-bd2m-770.xml"
    To leave a TC out, comment out its <class> line; to leave a platform out, comment out its <test>.
-->
